==German==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|de|Zone|t1=zone|-i}}. ''Zone'' is short for {{m|de|Sowjetische Besatzungszone}} (“Soviet occupation zone”), the common West German name for the [[w:German Democratic Republic|GDR]] before 1970 (and a colloquial name after it).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈtsoːni/|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m|Zonis|Zonis}}

# {{lb|de|historical|informal}} a citizen of the former [[w:German Democratic Republic|German Democratic Republic (GDR)]]

